10. _i3-la2-e_ 
#tr.ts: išaqqal
#tr.en: he (Ibni-tišpak) will pay.

11. u2-sze-te-eq-ma 
#tr.ts: uše(t)teqma
#tr.en: Should he let expire (the term),

