1. _1(u) gin2 1/3(disz) gin2 nagga_ 
#tr.ts: ešret šiqlī šaluš šiqil annakam
#tr.en: one-third of a shekel of tin for every 10

2. _masz2 dah-he2-dam_ 
#tr.ts: ṣibtam uṣṣab
